{
  "name": "Peel gate: check AI product-photo edits for drift",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 350,
        "content": "## Peel gate\nAn AI edit only goes through if it left the rest of the photo alone.\n\n1. Pick your **Google Gemini(PaLM) Api** credential on *Edit with Nano Banana*.\n2. Open **Config**: `maxDriftScore` is the gate (5 is strict). `peelApi` points at the public demo server; change it if you run your own. `geminiModel` must be an image-editing model your key can use.\n3. Optional: put a Slack or Discord incoming-webhook URL in `chatWebhook`.\n4. Activate, open the form URL, upload a product photo and an instruction.\n\nPass: the AI edit is returned as is. Fail: Peel's repaired image is returned instead, and the ledger summary is posted to chat.\n\nDocs: https://github.com/rahulgunwanistudy-2005/Peel/tree/main/integrations/n8n"
      },
      "id": "5c7f7979-47ab-5c90-a3bd-32f12e9c8ea5",
      "name": "Read me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -760,
        -440
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Edit a product photo (with a drift gate)",
        "formDescription": "Upload a product photo and say what to change. The edit is checked by Peel before it is accepted.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Product photo",
              "fieldType": "file",
              "multipleFiles": false,
              "acceptFileTypes": ".png, .jpg, .jpeg, .webp",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Instruction",
              "placeholder": "Put the bottle on a marble counter",
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "49fd5af2-962e-547d-836a-952dae400dcb",
      "name": "On form submission",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -760,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "d0b31c7e-2707-5773-9e6e-09cd72615d0a"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "9b189a9e-4ee8-5e9b-a0e7-09de25b5d6b0",
              "name": "peelApi",
              "value": "https://peel-api-rahulgunwanistudy-5466s-projects.vercel.app",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "1957bf8e-d382-5953-bc9a-75b768050bf1",
              "name": "geminiModel",
              "value": "gemini-2.5-flash-image",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "4ccc61fa-0a28-5922-8cf3-8a8fd1d5ff49",
              "name": "maxDriftScore",
              "value": 5,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "361f3a03-fe91-599a-95d2-c3fe2201dab1",
              "name": "chatWebhook",
              "value": "",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {
          "stripBinary": false,
          "includeBinary": true
        }
      },
      "id": "20b17cb8-0595-51ca-895b-e0fc42ff28e4",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -540,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "binaryToPropery",
        "binaryPropertyName": "Product_photo",
        "destinationKey": "photoBase64",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "748e0148-ab8c-5008-be07-6e2461815db9",
      "name": "Photo to base64",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.extractFromFile",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -320,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/{{ $('Config').first().json.geminiModel }}:generateContent",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "googlePalmApi",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({\n  contents: [{\n    parts: [\n      { inline_data: { mime_type: $('On form submission').first().binary.Product_photo.mimeType, data: $json.photoBase64 } },\n      { text: $('On form submission').first().json.Instruction }\n    ]\n  }],\n  generationConfig: { responseModalities: ['TEXT', 'IMAGE'] }\n}) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "854154e1-d278-5424-8f35-36acefeafa64",
      "name": "Edit with Nano Banana",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -100,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Gemini answers with text and image parts; keep the first image.\nconst parts = $input.first().json.candidates?.[0]?.content?.parts ?? [];\nconst image = parts.map((p) => p.inlineData ?? p.inline_data).find((d) => d && d.data);\nif (!image) {\n  throw new Error('The image model answered without an image. Try another instruction.');\n}\nreturn [{ json: { editedBase64: image.data, editedMime: image.mimeType ?? image.mime_type ?? 'image/png' } }];"
      },
      "id": "9c8fa47c-d43c-5678-b937-5de9a6b8ca1b",
      "name": "Pick the edited image",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        120,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "toBinary",
        "sourceProperty": "editedBase64",
        "binaryPropertyName": "edited",
        "options": {
          "fileName": "edited.png",
          "mimeType": "={{ $json.editedMime }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "70142393-e58e-5339-92b7-080f49b5425e",
      "name": "Edited image to file",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.convertToFile",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        340,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "combine",
        "combineBy": "combineByPosition",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "8c967f45-f9ee-5b15-b38c-a466ceb5c704",
      "name": "Original + edit",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        560,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.peelApi }}/v1/peel?inline=base64",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "multipart-form-data",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "parameterType": "formBinaryData",
              "name": "original",
              "inputDataFieldName": "Product_photo"
            },
            {
              "parameterType": "formBinaryData",
              "name": "edited",
              "inputDataFieldName": "edited"
            },
            {
              "name": "instruction",
              "value": "={{ $('On form submission').first().json.Instruction }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 180000
        }
      },
      "id": "9e51b8bb-bde7-5b55-aff7-41bd185c6cf4",
      "name": "Peel: measure the drift",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        780,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "38b264bc-fc4b-5c94-a6e4-05cf31209b69",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.ledger.drift_score }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $('Config').first().json.maxDriftScore }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "lte"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "fc3ddeeb-e177-52a8-bcdf-dc0a002e9f70",
      "name": "Drift within limit?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1000,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "toBinary",
        "sourceProperty": "images.edited",
        "binaryPropertyName": "image",
        "options": {
          "fileName": "edit.webp",
          "mimeType": "image/webp"
        }
      },
      "id": "23ccfbfb-66d1-5acb-ac61-06cf0f8f3c15",
      "name": "Pass: keep the AI edit",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.convertToFile",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1240,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "toBinary",
        "sourceProperty": "images.peeled",
        "binaryPropertyName": "image",
        "options": {
          "fileName": "peeled.webp",
          "mimeType": "image/webp"
        }
      },
      "id": "1ed19089-98de-54fa-a500-f7224e37ec49",
      "name": "Fail: use Peel's repair",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.convertToFile",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1240,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "51051d66-2ff4-5492-9371-d162289ed929",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Config').first().json.chatWebhook }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1e9ac09-852b-52eb-91e2-3446b8554fb7",
      "name": "Chat webhook set?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1460,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.chatWebhook }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({\n  text: 'Peel gate blocked an AI edit (drift score ' + $('Peel: measure the drift').first().json.ledger.drift_score + ', limit ' + $('Config').first().json.maxDriftScore + ').\\n'\n    + 'Instruction: ' + $('Peel: measure the drift').first().json.ledger.instruction + '\\n'\n    + $('Peel: measure the drift').first().json.ledger.headline + '\\n'\n    + $('Peel: measure the drift').first().json.ledger.regions.filter((r) => r.decision === 'revert').slice(0, 5).map((r) => '- ' + r.sentence).join('\\n') + '\\n'\n    + 'The repaired image was used instead; it is attached to this workflow run.'\n}) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "9ba6cd4f-e235-520d-8dd3-f5f822c32e1c",
      "name": "Post the ledger to chat",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1700,
        40
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    }
  ],
